  dialogues:
  - This part of the transformer is known as the POSITIONAL EMBEDDING
  - These components create the initial embedding of the input and output TOKEN sequence.
  - The TOKENS are put into a single matrix and EMBEDDED. Additional information
    about the position of each TOKEN in the sequence is also added to the EMBEDDING.
